  "title_zh": "习近平将赴印度出席金砖国家领导人第十八次会晤",
  "title_en": "Xi Jinping to Attend 18th BRICS Leaders' Summit in India",
  "summary_zh": "外交部9月10日宣布，应印度总理莫迪邀请，国家主席习近平将于9月12日至13日赴印度新德里出席金砖国家领导人第十八次会晤。",
  "summary_en": "The Foreign Ministry announced on September 10 that, at the invitation of Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi, President Xi Jinping will attend the 18th BRICS Leaders' Summit in New Delhi, India, on September 12-13.",
